WEBVTT

00:00.560 --> 00:02.561
The world was burning

00:29.464 --> 00:34.988
The lies were loud. We were the joking tabloid

00:35.048 --> 00:35.588
crowd.

00:39.051 --> 00:45.335
We had no shelter. We had no home. Just the open

00:45.395 --> 00:51.379
road and a telephone. But you.

00:54.432 --> 01:00.175
You built a fortress. You gave us walls when we

01:00.255 --> 01:03.737
were torn. You built a place to hide from the

01:03.797 --> 01:09.939
storm. You are the iron hands. You are the

01:09.960 --> 01:15.742
shield. The only army that would not yield. This

01:16.323 --> 01:20.945
is our fortress.

01:24.093 --> 01:31.039
This isn't LA. This isn't a dream. This is a

01:31.099 --> 01:37.665
warehouse. This is a scream. We're building our

01:37.725 --> 01:44.291
truth. We're building our sound. Right here on

01:44.311 --> 01:48.975
our hallowed ground. God is you.

01:52.035 --> 01:57.778
You built a fortress. You gave us walls when we

01:57.858 --> 02:01.379
were torn. You built a place to hide from the

02:01.399 --> 02:08.542
storm. You are the iron head. You are the shield.

02:08.742 --> 02:14.345
The only army that would not yield. This is our

02:14.465 --> 02:17.286
fortress.

02:52.573 --> 02:54.334
Our fortress,

02:55.835 --> 02:59.238
our home

02:59.298 --> 03:04.061
We are the fortress

